## Breaking Changes

Before updating, check the release notes for compatibility changes. Follow [Updating FOSSBilling](/maintenance/updating/) for the update procedure and [Upgrading from 0.7.x to 0.8.x](/maintenance/updating/0-7-to-0-8/) for migration steps.

## Security Updates

See [GitHub security advisories](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/security/advisories) for affected versions and fixes.
